From 349e45111bcf92753995285246bfdf0955ecdc8b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 12:10:52 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 14/18] Add application and optimization examples

Add three application examples (catchment sensitivity with
one-at-a-time and Morris screening, warming scenarios with traced runs,
and a minimax-regret reservoir policy study) and three optimization
examples (SciPy vectorized differential evolution, fcmaes CMA-ES
ask/tell with whole populations through score_matrix, and fcmaes
BiteOpt and C++ CMA-ES minimizers with failure penalties), sharing
seeded synthetic inputs. run_examples.py refreshes the saved outputs.
A Rust example screens reservoir rules through Prepared::score_matrix.
All outputs come from runs of the installed 0.3.0 wheel.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
